{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_30018_01_h",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:36964ddeeae6664f30d04b2d7849c96f3b2837fa44bf72b5108b5b18addda033",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_h:cmd-000018:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a1269628ae1a31b7c3027a5c36e0f5ec7f2b4dcc51bd33ce7866202fe4c2df78",
      "text": "休息中……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_h:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2a1bda6ab68d87d749c1d9f2f3f78ec0463d4bab08b984d67125c4f7ba16dc07",
      "text": "聊不习惯的话题，\n真是相当不容易啊。后背都冒汗了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_h:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f5082a98ca1a814c17f567dedbd4d839748146abdf2ca9fa001ff5332e1eb8d2",
      "text": "会吗？冬马君，发挥得很好呀？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_h:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ecb291e96feb81fbffe222fbcc84facf8622aff85360a5ca62dcc9034da21778",
      "text": "那是因为北斗巧妙地圆回来了啊。\n谢啦，帮大忙了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_h:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7c61a4cf8d8ec174c1df7839240d1a74a42c1527d0e4fdd3c5b57e25234d0d85",
      "text": "……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_h:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:11ed498a5ed6c831e96f15d5337e1135189c630e1d29dfa2a2be830e47d94236",
      "text": "怎么了，北斗君？\n发呆成这样。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_h:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8b8956035dc5e1dee56fb9020ff9702ed7910b1e74c55b5b71e8c49676921fb8",
      "text": "嗯，没什么……\n就是下一场录制要回答的这封信啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_h:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cd41a335e93178d20f75cb46e255b5e769a56379f96aeaae1bc6aef4c0e12267",
      "text": "“失恋了什么事都提不起劲来。\n希望能得到一句让我振作起来的话”吗。这该怎么办才好呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_h:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c799b86c7d34aeae3fab57c3311d59e893a627cc5faebbeb363cdf2a46edbbfd",
      "text": "怎么说呢，能非常强烈地感受到对方的心情呢。\n感觉这段文字就是她的全部了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_h:cmd-000095:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:29aefdb60e3c0684ceda35f23289ddd5efd48bac6ac3d9add37330d301f2f9c6",
      "text": "嗯。正因为能理解，\n我不知不觉也陷入了沉思。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_h:cmd-000100:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fef9484509104a2b20ce8f1531668418e20a5562eed3537f175b39371db86e24",
      "text": "虽然很想立刻飞奔到这位天使酱的身边，\n但隔着广播是做不到的呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
